      "writtenOn": "2018-01-15T10:12:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m a bit confused by \"0: Write these bits to 0.\" in the datasheet, and if that refers to bits D15/D14.\n\nAlso, I\u0027m concerned about modifying _any_ of these registers, as the user guide says: \"It is recommended that these values are not changed, unless absolutely required by the application. Table\": it looks like it\u0027s going to change the charging algorithm behaviour itself (see \"1.2.5 End-of-Charge Detection\" for example).",
      "revId": "5a33fd65f4dc909d2cbec7d16c4219b9b32596f8",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
